00:11:56.957 --> 00:11:58.500
And if you try to take it away from me.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:11:59.540
You're going to be a different person.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.920
And then I may not love you the same way.

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:03.485
But then I don't know.

00:12:03.485 --> 00:12:06.880
That's just the way I feel
that I should be loved.

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:08.900
So that's the way I love people.

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:11.800
And it's just not reciprocated down here.

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:12.636
I see that.

00:12:12.636 --> 00:12:15.215
But I can't expect for
people to love me the way

00:12:15.215 --> 00:12:16.580
I love them.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:19.650
I just need to love them
the way God expects me

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:21.450
to love people.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:25.230
I have five kids and I do
not raise my five children

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:28.210
but all five of my children are raised by.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.147
Well, four of them are
raised by their dad,

00:12:30.147 --> 00:12:31.810
they have the same dad.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.560
And then my fifth daughter is raised

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:36.547
by my dad because she
doesn't have their father.

00:12:36.547 --> 00:12:40.410
My first four children
were my ex husband's kids

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.640
They all are drug-free.

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:46.220
They all are college bound.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:47.430
They all are.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.970
Well except for two of
them, they all have kids.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:55.878
And they, one of them
is a Jehovah witness.

00:12:55.878 --> 00:12:57.811
Two of them are married.

00:12:57.811 --> 00:13:00.420
And my 19 year old's going to college.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.447
And I'm trying to figure out God

00:13:02.447 --> 00:13:04.800
maybe I did do the right thing

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.860
by stepping out of their
life because my mother goes,

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.690
well I did the right thing
because I was an addict.

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:10.523
I did the right thing

00:13:10.523 --> 00:13:12.473
because I wasn't sure I was
the right mother for them

00:13:12.473 --> 00:13:14.232
because see, you raised me and

00:13:14.232 --> 00:13:16.750
and you can only do what you know

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.300
My ex husband says when you're sober

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.900
you're the best thing,

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.173
that could happen to these kids and to me.

00:13:24.173 --> 00:13:27.489
Boyy when you put that shit in your mouth

00:13:27.489 --> 00:13:30.412
you turn into a totally different person.

00:13:30.412 --> 00:13:32.751
And I, and I can be
selfish I can be selfish

00:13:32.751 --> 00:13:36.118
but I do believe that
I chose to leave them

00:13:36.118 --> 00:13:38.810
in New Jersey, with there
family, with his family

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:41.814
because to bring them with
me and for them to be raised

00:13:41.814 --> 00:13:45.440
with me or my family, I kept seeing myself

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.770
I kept seeing the cycle
and I said it has to stop.

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:51.090
And it stops with me and my daughter

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:53.160
when I told her that after I got sober

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:56.364
I was sober for like 22 months, 21 months.

00:13:56.364 --> 00:13:59.393
And I went back to New
Jersey to visit them.

00:14:01.093 --> 00:14:04.670
And they were so proud.

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.967
And they told me, don't you
ever, ever disappear on us?

00:14:07.967 --> 00:14:10.003
We didn't know if you were dead or alive

00:14:10.003 --> 00:14:13.025
and it was all we were worried about.

00:14:13.025 --> 00:14:17.700
We didn't care what you did
because the truth came out.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.820
When you left dad, it wasn't
about you doing the drugs.

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:23.397
It was about dad sending
you out to get the drugs.

00:14:23.397 --> 00:14:25.740
And when you aren't here to
get sent out to get the drugs

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.640
he had to go get his drugs himself.

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:28.660
Then he came back

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.456
and they told me, they said, sometimes her

00:14:32.456 --> 00:14:35.310
my oldest my two oldest
daughters said sometimes

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.530
they would talk and there'd be a room.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.090
And they would say, you know what?

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:39.800
Sometimes I wish dad was dead because

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:43.220
if he was dead at least, we
wouldn't have to worry about you

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:46.030
and then they would say mom
did the best thing she could.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.610
By leaving us here and going
to do what she had to do.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.350
So when I showed up on Facebook

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:51.440
and they showed up on Facebook

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.433
and I was like, can I come visit you?

00:14:53.433 --> 00:14:56.622
And the program that I was at,
I had been there for so long.

00:14:56.622 --> 00:14:58.170
They let me go out of town.

00:14:58.170 --> 00:14:59.500
They let me fly to New Jersey

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.430
for four days and visit my family.

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:03.239
So I'm like, okay, give it to me.

00:15:03.239 --> 00:15:05.320
That was part of my recovery plan.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:08.410
Let me, let me have it, give it to me.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:10.240
And I asked them, I said

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:12.380
were you ever touched, I
mean, I needed to know.

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:14.700
And they told me no, they told me all.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.319
They remember when we were in

00:15:16.319 --> 00:15:18.450
when I was giving them
baths and I was telling them

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:21.265
these are so important to me,
these are your private parts.

00:15:21.265 --> 00:15:23.000
Don't let anybody touch it.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.740
I mean, as, as kids they're coming up

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:26.573
and I'm teaching them this

00:15:26.573 --> 00:15:30.260
and I said, I don't care
who it is, whoever it is.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.850
If somebody touches you
and you feel uncomfortable

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:34.680
with them touching you
and they won't stop.

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.860
Tell your dad, if it's
your dad, tell your aunt

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:38.027
if it's your aunt, tell your teacher,

00:15:38.027 --> 00:15:40.057
tell somebody, tell them, crossing guard

00:15:40.057 --> 00:15:42.624
keep telling until
somebody does something.

00:15:42.624 --> 00:15:44.474
And I meant that and I
instilled it in my children.

00:15:44.474 --> 00:15:48.090
And I told them, I tell
them, when I got on the plane

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.958
to come back here to do some recovery

00:15:49.958 --> 00:15:51.640
and I left him in New Jersey, I said

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:54.123
one thing I want you to
do is never tell them

00:15:54.123 --> 00:15:55.573
that they don't have a voice.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:57.420
Never tell them to shut up

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.097
because it's all my mom told me to do.

00:15:59.097 --> 00:16:01.730
Children want to be seen and that hurt.

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.273
- [Interviewer] So where do you stay?

00:16:03.273 --> 00:16:08.273
- I kind of stay in the
streets, but not on the streets.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.498
When I have a place that I can go

00:16:10.498 --> 00:16:13.460
and sleep when I really,
really need to sleep.

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.290
Because the last time I slept in a tent

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.080
and I kind of woke up with
somebody in my tent that wasn't

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.300
in my tent when I went to sleep

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:21.000
and then I would take a shower

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.246
and I wasn't as clean as
I thought I should be.

00:16:23.246 --> 00:16:25.518
And I can't like, I want to accuse him

00:16:25.518 --> 00:16:27.580
but I didn't wake up in the middle of it.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.760
I woke up afterwards,
but I'm getting flashes.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.240
You know what I'm saying?

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.510
I'm getting flashes of things happening

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:37.861
and I'm looking at him and
I'm like you're a rapist.

00:16:37.861 --> 00:16:40.690
And it's all changed
for you to be a rapist

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:43.022
in your eyes because, and he's like,

00:16:43.022 --> 00:16:44.440
Oh so you're mad at me.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:45.740
The fuck you mean, am I mad at you?

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:46.573
Yeah I'm mad at you

00:16:46.573 --> 00:16:49.280
because what hurts me the
most is that I trusted you.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:52.210
You know, I didn't have
any choice for myself

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:54.460
or it might've happened to me in the past

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:56.840
because I kind of thought I
did sleeping on the streets

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:58.550
but I didn't remember it.

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:01.350
So it wasn't as present
or I didn't catch it.

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.250
But I trusted, you know

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:06.130
I call you a friend and
this is what you do.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:08.260
So if I picked you to be my friend

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.500
then there's something
wrong with my picker.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.901
There's something wrong with me.

00:17:11.901 --> 00:17:12.734
That these are the type

00:17:12.734 --> 00:17:14.570
of people that I choose to be my friend.

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:16.030
That's what I think.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:17.484
So now I've got to deal with it.

00:17:17.484 --> 00:17:19.543
Everything comes back to me

00:17:19.543 --> 00:17:22.680
and every choice and every
decision that I make.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.260
So I don't know if I'm
down here trying to figure

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:28.650
out what type of person
that I am, or I need to be

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:33.080
or if I don't know, but I know I'm tired.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:35.090
I'm truly, truly tired.

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:36.940
And I think this is
going to be my last cycle

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.663
of downtown this way.

00:17:40.743 --> 00:17:41.576
Yeah.

